id bvwm-tile-mon-next
group x11-wm/bvwm
label Send to next monitor
chord Super+Shift+period
enabled 0
enabled 1 bvwm
session 0
session 1 bvwm
command Current TileSendMon next
repeat 0
greeter 0
listen 0
desc Send the focused window to the next monitor. Fullscreen fills that monitor. bvwm owns the key.
